# Vercel only builds the dashboard: `vercel.json` runs the build inside
# frontend/ and serves frontend/dist. Everything below belongs to the detection
# engine, which is deployed separately (render.yaml) because its stream loop is
# a background thread with in-memory state and cannot run on serverless.
#
# Without this the deploy uploads the engine's 13 MB held-out split, the trained
# artifacts and 33 committed run logs on every build, none of which the static
# bundle can use.

ml-engine/
supabase/
tools/
docs/
logs/

*.pdf
*.md
!frontend/**
